{"id":"vod_sn_36904","vodId":"36904","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"I s Pure","name_cn":"I s Pure","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0563d3631962016047de79f1afa94676.jpg"},"summary":"美丽端庄的伊织（伊藤静 配音）是学校里的风云人物，甚至有狂热的粉丝在学校里专门为她组织了“后援会”。这样的伊织自然也吸引了一贵（野村胜人 配音）的注意，但一贵自知平凡无奇，选择了将感情深深地埋藏在心底。　　一起意外的发生令伊织陷入了困境，所幸得到了一贵和其好友寺谷（小伏伸之 配音）出手相助，才得以平安度过难关，伊织和一贵之间的关系也因此迎来了新的局面。就在两人距离越来越近之时，一贵久违的青梅竹马逸姬（中世明日香 配音）横插一足，对一贵发起了热烈的进攻，伊织因此误会了一贵真正的心意，在悲伤之中，她决心成全一贵和逸姬。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SE8awpCQv01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rw0NpjhXpg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TAApKtMiAC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CvpAPCKWMj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3FeZrY8e2a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wz5PZ03zhj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nQ96sUxb8a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3B2uDjts0J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/99gykXmamU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b92jikY7TT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c5cT3PjLnJ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:17.713Z"}